WEBVTT

00:12:29.284 --> 00:12:31.042
And if that doesn't work,

00:12:31.066 --> 00:12:35.609
find others, who are able
to represent your views.

00:12:36.895 --> 00:12:42.338
Because by doing so, we can begin
to change the answer to the question

00:12:42.362 --> 00:12:43.512
"Am I safe?"

00:12:45.111 --> 00:12:49.095
(Applause)